RD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> with sample covariance <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{S}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, and let <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Q} \\in M_n(\\mathbb{R})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D410 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D440 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.081em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Q</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> be orthogonal.</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\alph*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>Prove that the data <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Q}\\mathbf{x}_1, \\dots,\n\\mathbf{Q}\\mathbf{x}_N\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D410 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2026\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D410 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Q</mi></mrow><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Q</mi></mrow><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> have sample covariance <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Q}\\mathbf{S}\\mathbf{Q}^{\\top}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D410 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-msup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D410 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22A4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, and deduce that the total\nvariance <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tr}\\mathbf{S}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tr</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is unchanged.</li>\n<li>Prove that for any orthonormal basis <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf{q}_1, \\dots, \\mathbf{q}_n)\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2026\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, the sum of the variances of the\ndata in the <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"n\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> directions <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{q}_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> equals <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tr}\\mathbf{S}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tr</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n<li>Deduce that no orthonormal frame can make every coordinate variance\nsmall: some <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{q}_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> always has\nvariance at least <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tr}\\mathbf{S}/n\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tr</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. For the\ndata of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"exm-pca-four-points\">@exm-pca-four-points</span>, which\nframes attain that bound?</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch24-applied/10-principal-components.html"}